    "causal_summary": "The 087-speckit-deep-analysis remediation identified and fixed 3 critical bugs and 15+ moderate misalignments, but deferred 4 known limitations that require separate implementation work: (1) existing SQLite databases have a drifted schema with three conflicting DDL definitions causing silent INSERT failures, (2) stale Gate 4/6 references remain in 7 active files plus the legacy install guide, (3) three spec management scripts are undocumented in capability tables, and (4) minor signal handler gaps exist in the MCP server",
